# Walkthrough: Phase 0 — Project Scaffolding

I have successfully initialized the FORGE project scaffold. This phase establishes the foundation for the entire application, including the tech stack, design system, state management, and mock API layer.

## Project Structure Overview

The project follows a modular architecture as specified:

- **src/modules/**: Feature-specific modules (presently empty shell).
- **src/shared/**: Shared types, state, components, and API layer.
- **src/app/**: Core application logic and routing.

## Key Accomplishments

### 1. Tooling & Configuration
- Initialized [package.json](file:///D:/Hoopit/Apps/Forge/v2/package.json) with exact dependency versions (React 18.3.1, TypeScript 5.5, Vite 5.3).
- Configured Vite with `@` path aliases for cleaner imports.
- Implemented [tailwind.config.ts](file:///D:/Hoopit/Apps/Forge/v2/tailwind.config.ts) with custom industrial dark theme tokens.

### 2. Unified Type System
- Created a master type definition file [src/shared/types/index.ts](file:///D:/Hoopit/Apps/Forge/v2/src/shared/types/index.ts) containing all project interfaces, ensuring zero `any` types.

### 3. Global State Management
- Implemented a modular Zustand store with 7 specialized slices (Auth, Org, ActiveContext, UI, AI, Notification, Job).
- Configured persistence for UI preferences using `localStorage`.

### 4. Mock API Integration
- Setup MSW v2 (Mock Service Worker) to intercept API calls when `VITE_MOCK_API=true`.
- Initialized the service worker in the `public/` directory using `npx msw init public --save`.
- Created initial mock fixtures for Organizations, Users, and Projects.

### 5. Design System Foundation
- Implemented core components: [Button](file:///D:/Hoopit/Apps/Forge/v2/src/shared/components/Button.tsx#12-17) (with primary, secondary, ai, and agent variants), [Card](file:///D:/Hoopit/Apps/Forge/v2/src/shared/components/Card.tsx#4-7) (with glassmorphism), and [Input](file:///D:/Hoopit/Apps/Forge/v2/src/shared/components/Input.tsx#4-8).
- Configured [index.css](file:///D:/Hoopit/Apps/Forge/v2/src/index.css) with Tailwind directives and custom utility classes.

### 6. Routing & Entry Point
- Established a routing skeleton in [src/app/router.tsx](file:///D:/Hoopit/Apps/Forge/v2/src/app/router.tsx) with placeholder pages for all major modules.
- Initialized [main.tsx](file:///D:/Hoopit/Apps/Forge/v2/src/main.tsx) with MSW readiness and React Query provider.

